# Bulky per-run artefacts that are rebuildable from the committed records.
# Everything else under runs/ is committed: run.json / selection.json / curve.csv
# (the records the manifest and the GPU ledger cite) and the 12 frozen
# checkpoints (1 MB each, the objects the one-shot Test pass re-verifies by SHA-256).
runs/**/train_predictions.npz
runs/**/valid_predictions.npz
runs/smoke/**/checkpoint.pt
# Frozen per-molecule predictions + the SPARSE_ONLY coefficients: small, and every
# consumer re-verifies the SHA-256 recorded in analysis/checkpoint_manifest.json
!analysis/predictions/*.npz
